[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4871281484","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120875#issuecomment-4871281484","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120875","id":4871281484,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIlnbTA","user":{"login":"spirit122","id":67442190,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDQyMTkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67442190?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122","html_url":"https://github.com/spirit122","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spirit122/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-02T23:28:32Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T23:28:32Z","body":"Additional local validation: non-threaded release Web .NET template also builds successfully with the same static LibGodot path.\n\n```sh\nscons platform=web target=template_release module_mono_enabled=yes arch=wasm32 \\\n    library_type=static_library threads=no lto=none disable_crash_handler=yes -j8\n```\n\nResult:\n\n```text\nbin/godot.web.template_release.wasm32.nothreads.mono.zip   40,398,303 bytes\nbin/libgodot.web.template_release.wasm32.nothreads.a       170,583,688 bytes\n```\n\nThe generated zip includes `libgodot/libgodot.a`, `libgodot/config.json`, `libgodot/js_library/*.js`, `libgodot/pre_js/callMain_stub.js`, and `libgodot/post_js/patch_em_gl.js